{"catalogHash":"9b61e25e4b3ab6b03de3cdf4a596bd440566c4e37005c9524d39027c299eea8e","contract":"cerebro.node-modifier-detail/v2","definition":{"id":"nec_path_psymn","versions":[{"applications":[{"evidence":{"coordinate":{"x":25,"y":48},"pointer":"/map/walkableTiles/189/defenderBuffs/0","sourceId":"map-c3cb045203ee79fcc186-2026eb5a"},"hash":"2d16bafd6b64eff8db38bc5626e8790d1b9a89fa14166e07b0872d5fdb2c507a","nativeIconKey":"node-glyph-d481ed80c676261b","observations":3,"raw":{"buffAmount":1,"buffAppearance":"N","buffDescription":"Whenever the Attacker blocks an attack they gain 5% of a Bar of Power. At the start of the fight the Defender activates a timer of 12 seconds and randomly selects Heavy Attack, Special Attack or Block an Attack. This timer is paused during Special Attacks and while either champion is charging or performing a Heavy Attack. If the selected action is not performed before the timer expires, all of the Attacker's Buffs are removed and they are dealt a burst of Direct Damage equal to 15% of their max Health. If the selected action is performed, the Defender selects a new action and restarts the timer. Action selections that have been successfully performed will not repeat until all actions have been successfully performed.","isExtra":false,"nodeSource":{"attk":false,"bt":[],"buffs":[{"Action":"","Data":"nec_path_psymn","Footer":"","Header":"","MaxQuantity":1,"MinQuantity":1,"Quantity":1,"Type":"buff"}],"remainActive":false,"type":{"name":"Local","value":2}}},"text":"Whenever the Attacker blocks an attack they gain 5% of a Bar of Power. At the start of the fight the Defender activates a timer of 12 seconds and randomly selects Heavy Attack, Special Attack or Block an Attack. This timer is paused during Special Attacks and while either champion is charging or performing a Heavy Attack. If the selected action is not performed before the timer expires, all of the Attacker's Buffs are removed and they are dealt a burst of Direct Damage equal to 15% of the